  { q: "How is Qin Shi Huang similar to Roman emperors?", a: "Like Augustus Caesar, who transitioned Rome into a centralized empire, Qin Shi Huang transitioned China from divided feudal states to a centralized empire, standardizing laws, infrastructure, and administration." },
